internal/domain/models.go contains domain types and validation helpers adapted
from github.com/yoophi/td (originally github.com/marcus/td), commit
c64d7873d8f555dd49875e34e6b39ae5257e2e0c, internal/models/models.go.
The upstream MIT license is preserved in third_party/td/LICENSE.

internal/adapter/httpapi/receiptcodec/issue.go maps those adapted domain fields
to the documented Issue DTO. The same upstream attribution applies.

internal/domain/reviewpolicy/policy.go and policy_test.go are adapted from
internal/reviewpolicy at the same upstream commit c64d7873d8f555dd49875e34e6b39ae5257e2e0c.
Imports are mapped to this repository domain; policy behavior and tests are preserved.

internal/domain/tdq lexer, parser, AST and corresponding tests are adapted from
internal/query at the same upstream commit. Imports map to the backend domain.

internal/domain/tdq/evaluator.go, evaluator_test.go and cross_entity.go adapt
internal/query/evaluator.go and the pure cross-entity evaluation from execute.go
at the same upstream commit. SQL compilation and database execution are omitted.
Facts-based execution, issue query validation, dependency predicates, activity
date equality and deterministic sorting are backend adaptations.
